# Morrowind vampirism, Clan Berne: catching Porphyric Hemophilia and the turn, carried by Skyrim's vampirism.
# The Berne vampires of the Andrethi, Othrelas and Raviro tombs (Vampire_Berne gives each its blood) attack a
# stranger and flee after a few blows (authored Flee 70), so the player seeks out each in turn; their hits pass on
# "Vampire Blood Berne", which converts as Skyrim's vampire disease (10% a hit). Three days on, a sleep in Caius
# Cosades' bed turns the player: VampireCheck starts Vampire_Berne_PC (PCVampire 1, VampClan 2, the clan's
# Specials) and Skyrim's PlayerVampireQuest.VampireChange makes the player a Skyrim vampire.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_berne_infect
approach 05C0FDC7
wait 200
approach 059B5B46
wait 200
approach 052888E1
wait 200
approach 0575CD40
wait 200
approach 05C2DA8D
wait 200
approach 059B25F1
wait 200
approach 0569E579
wait 200
approach 05BB4113
wait 200
approach 05A07011
wait 200
approach 05A71044
wait 200
approach 0578DA86
wait 200
approach 05873FAC
until 600 player->GetSpell "Vampire Blood Berne" == 1
end

case va_berne_turn
run
player->PositionCell -60 -30 60 0 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
wait 60
rest 120 05201D4E PCVampire == 1
expect VampClan == 2
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Berne Specials" == 1
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Sun Damage" == 0
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Blood Berne" == 0
end
